  "notes": "Very first pressings, including white label promo copies were pressed without the band's name on both labels. Also shares the exact same matrix etchings as promo copies. This was corrected on later pressings. A misprint copy also exists with incorrect track listings printed on both labels.\n\nIncludes either the orange Elektra company sleeve or the black one with pictures of the new east coast company headquarters.\nElektra Records 1855 Broadway New York City 10023 is printed on both inner sleeves.\n\nMastering done by Lee Hulko \"LH\" in dead-wax.  Mastering House: Sterling Sound \"SS\" in dead-wax. \n\nPrinted in U.S.A.\nAll selections copyright © Paradox Music BMI\nSpecial thanks to [a1651149].",
